        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2294] For wireless communication an SDP server shall send the payload in the order as shown in Table 26 and Table 27. A byte with a lower number shall be sent before a byte with a higher number. The payload starts with byte 1 and ends with byte 59.",
            "block_bbox": [
