        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4101] For pairing and positioning device support the SDP client shall reset the counter for sent SECC discovery request messages after a valid SECC discovery response message has been received with the payload parameter \"DiagStatus = Ongoing\".",
