        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4102] For wireless communication an SDP server shall send the SECC discovery response message with the payload parameter \"DiagStatus = Ongoing\" as long as no EVID is detected by the pairing and positioning device when the element PPD/P2PS of the SDP request was set to value \"PPD on infrastructure\" according to Table 24. The parameter EVSEID may be sent optionally.",
